COMMENT PRESERVATION WITH COMPACT COLLECTIONS AND EXPLICIT KEYS
---
# explicit keys
? exp_a # after exp_a
: 1 # inline 1
? exp_b
# compact map with zero-indent list
rules:
  - changed-files:
    - any-glob: '*.dart'
    other: true # keep other
---
- [update, [exp_a], 10]
- [update, [exp_b], 20]
- [remove, [rules, 0, changed-files, 0]]
- [remove, [exp_a]]
